# Esc mid-turn, then a new prompt: the first turn is interrupted and the second finishes, as in
# tests/fixtures/claude-hooks/tui-esc-*.log. Esc lands while a slow command runs, so the turn is
# still going however fast claude answers (claude's sandbox lets `sleep` run unasked). Two prompts.
agent claude-code
recording tui-esc
timeout 180
expect interrupted finished

sleep 5
press down
press enter
wait-for SessionStart
sleep 2
type run the shell command sleep 30, then reply with the single word ok
press enter
wait-for PreToolUse
sleep 2
press esc
sleep 3
type reply with the single word ok
press enter
wait-for Stop
